tes too large I think a toggle could be helpful, but I have absolutely zero data about that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2583781917/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888793032","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101274#issuecomment-2888793032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101274","id":2888793032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sL3vI","user":{"login":"ChizuNoYama","id":5799879,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTk4Nzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5799879?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChizuNoYama","html_url":"https://github.com/ChizuNoYama","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChizuNoYama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChizuNoYama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChizuNoYama/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChizuNoYama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChizuNoYama/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChizuNoYama/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChizuNoYama/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChizuNoYama/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChizuNoYama/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-18T06:01:17Z","updated_at":"2025-05-18T06:01:17Z","body":"This is actually messing up serialization in C# while using `System.Text.Json`. Throwing an exception since it's expecting an integer. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/28